# Project Structure

## Canonical Folders

- `docs/`: product direction, architecture, decisions and skill registry.
- `develop/`: implementation plan, active checkpoint, local runbook, stages and evidence.
- `memory/`: current state, handoff, questions and lessons.
- `rules/`: concise project rules.
- `hooks/`: prompt/checklist hooks.
- `agents/`: role contracts.
- `work/`: volatile local artifacts.
- `archive/`: closed or stale artifacts.

## Boundaries

- Generated folders are not source of truth.
- Secrets do not belong in docs, memory, evidence or chat output.
- Heavy logs/traces/screenshots stay under `output/` or `work/` and are linked from evidence.
